
### Experience Gallery
![Gallery](assets/screenshots/02-gallery-experience.png)

> The gallery provides visual proof of successful fishing outcomes but lacks diversity in the experience being communicated. Images primarily focus on individuals holding fish, offering limited insight into the broader experience (e.g., group interaction, environment, process, or amenities). This creates a one-dimensional narrative that does not fully help users envision the overall experience or differentiate it from alternatives, potentially limiting its impact on decision-making.
